   "sourceHash": "9549024ce15af6e6cd5bc7feb59b4ab762fea9a9310a1c111dc73eaf4df4ce32",
   "text": "别墅 — 最短时长为 7 晚",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f9f0f82350a04b24dd7a",
   "sourceHash": "f9f0f82350a04b24dd7a9763c71bd04c856a5e4736ef18582519423df8c457bf",
   "text": "价格有效期：2025年4月1日至2027年9月30日。单人：一人入住；双人：两人合住一栋别墅。最少 7 晚。[[OPEN_1]]查看已公布的价目表[[CLOSE_1]]。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0ed1e9d33a31df583b01",
   "sourceHash": "0ed1e9d33a31df583b017c1050edf6214112a44569aa8deb0a15ec87f8d49019",
   "text": "这与 Panchakarma（潘查卡玛）方案有何不同？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_15cd0320c686e05b4e60",
   "sourceHash": "15cd0320c686e05b4e6024ee89ea701da058208ac475540decc40493917c447e",
   "text": "您的医生可以结合您的健康目标，为您讲解每个方案拟采用的疗法和日常安排，帮助您了解哪种方式适合您。您接受的具体疗程取决于您的个人评估结果。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ce581806d5228a2d4394",
   "sourceHash": "ce581806d5228a2d4394b93888013ce94b39c5c3da1b3e26b9661c841adc820a",
   "text": "我如何知道本方案是否适合我？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a87019e924dbd36c4f8a",
   "sourceHash": "a87019e924dbd36c4f8a223769028dd0afe1ec518162be74c2d0c79c20780d19",
   "text": "请在入院前告知您的病史、目前症状和目标。请说明您正在患有的疾病、疲劳情况以及既往治疗经历，以便医生评估是否适合。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
